sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant UI as The Mantel (UI)
    participant Core as Hearth Suite Core
    participant Key as key-manager
    participant Ident as Key Directory (opt-in)
    participant Crypto as Crypto Module
    User->>UI: Seal Bundle for "Maria"
    UI->>Core: seal(bundle, [Maria])
    Core->>Ident: fetch Maria PQ public key
    Ident-->>Core: ML-KEM public key (or via QR/contact)
    Core->>Crypto: generate content key (AES-256)
    Core->>Crypto: ML-KEM encapsulate to each recipient
    Crypto-->>Core: wrapped content keys + sealed payload
    Core->>Key: sign manifest (ML-DSA)
    Core-->>UI: Bundle sealed ("Only you & Maria")
    UI-->>User: Sealed status shown
